{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08471","headline":"送张遥之寿阳幕府 · 李白","name":"送张遥之寿阳幕府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寿阳信天险，天险横荆关。\n苻坚百万衆，遥阻八公山。\n不假筑长城，大贤在其间。\n战夫若熊虎，破敌有余闲。\n张子勇且英，少轻卫霍孱。\n投躯紫髯将，千里望风颜。\n勖尔効才略，功成衣锦还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}